{'symbol': 'FLT', 'date': '2023-06-09 09:28:00', 'title': 'FLEETCOR CLOSES OUT CHAPTER IN FTC CASE', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FLEETCOR TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: FLT), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT RECEIVED THE ANTICIPATED COURT ORDER IN THE FTC MARKETING PRACTICES AND DISCLOSURE CASE. AS EXPECTED, THE COURT ORDER LIMITS ITS INJUNCTIVE RELIEF TO FLEETCOR'S FUEL CARD BUSINESS IN THE UNITED STATES. THE ORDER REQUIRES FLEETCOR TO IMPLEMENT A SET OF DISCLOSURE PRACTICES, SUCH AS CREDITING CUSTOMER PAYMENTS ON RECEIPT DATE OR PROVIDING NOTICE TO CUSTOMERS IN ADVANCE OF RECEIVING A NEW FEE. AS PREVIOUSLY."}